  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 cup heavy cream",
    "2 tablespoon unsweetened almond milk",
    "1 large egg yolk",
    "2 tablespoon allulose",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 ounce raspberries (fresh or frozen)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-mason-jar-ice-cream-berries/#wprm-recipe-54873-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Mason-Jar-Ice-Cream-Berries-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small container or jar, add heavy cream, almond milk, and allulose.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-mason-jar-ice-cream-berries/#wprm-recipe-54873-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Mason-Jar-Ice-Cream-Berries-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the egg yolk and vanilla extract. NOTE: If are are concerned with raw egg yolks, you can heat the mixture to 140F in a saucepan over low heat. Continuously stir until it comes to temperature, then add to jar to shake.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-mason-jar-ice-cream-berries/#wprm-recipe-54873-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Mason-Jar-Ice-Cream-Berries-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Seal with a lid and shake vigorously for 5 minutes. You really want to shake this up hard so that everything combines well and the volume increases as the cream whips.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-mason-jar-ice-cream-berries/#wprm-recipe-54873-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Mason-Jar-Ice-Cream-Berries-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add fresh or frozen raspberries into the mixture, then place in the freezer and chill for at least 3 hours.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-mason-jar-ice-cream-berries/#wprm-recipe-54873-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Keto-Mason-Jar-Ice-Cream-Berries-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once ice cream is at the consistency you want, take out and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-mason-jar-ice-cream-berries/#wprm-recipe-54873-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
